===Etymology===
{{bor+|en|ar|الْحِجَاز}}. {{root|en|ar|ح ج ز}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# The [[mountainous]] [[area]] of [[northwest]] [[Saudi Arabia]] which gave rise to early [[Islam]] and which contains the [[site]]s of many [[holy]] [[place]]s.
# An independent [[kingdom]] in the area between 1924 and 1932, when it merged with [[Najd]] to form the present Saudi Arabia.

